---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Southern Europe Capital Strategy 2026 | Costa Ledger" 
  minimalHeader={true} 
  headerLabel="SPECIAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT" 
  isAdvertorial={true}
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-14">
    
   <!-- ARTICLE HEADER (VAULT STYLE) -->
    <header class="mb-8 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-6 text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- TITLE -->
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#121212] leading-tight mb-6">
        The Capital Shift: How High-Net-Worth Investors Are Navigating Europe's New Fiscal Rules
      </h1>

      <!-- LEDE WITH GOLD ACCENT LINE -->
      <div class="border-l-2 border-[#C5A059] pl-4 sm:pl-5 py-0.5">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#666666] font-sans leading-relaxed italic">
          A quiet overhaul of cross-border tax incentives and residency pathways is prompting institutional investors and private capitals to restructure assets across Spain, Portugal, and Italy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
        alt="Southern Europe Investment Asset" 
        class="w-full h-[280px] sm:h-[400px] object-cover border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm"
      />
      <!-- IMAGE CAPTION (INCREASED FONT SIZE) -->
      <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#666666] mt-2.5 block text-right italic font-sans">
        Market positioning across key Mediterranean corridors, Q3 2026.
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTENT (NARRATIVE - VAULT TYPOGRAPHY) -->
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#2A2E33] space-y-6">
      <p class="first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:font-serif first-letter:font-bold first-letter:text-[#121212] first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-3 first-letter:mt-1">
        As Southern European economies realign their foreign investment incentives, high-net-worth individuals are moving quickly to adapt to shifting legislative frameworks.
      </p>

      <p>
        The window for legacy residency pathways and simplified tax regimes is closing. What remains requires a far more strategic approach to asset allocation, legal structuring, and lifestyle migration.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#121212] mt-8 mb-2">
        Key Strategic Takeaways
      </h2>

      <p>
        In our latest private research, we analyze the exact regulatory shifts taking place in Q3 2026 and outline actionable strategies for wealth preservation and cross-border mobility.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- HIGH-CONVERTING CTA BLOCK (BRAND STYLED) -->
    <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-[#F9F9F6] border border-[#C5A059] p-8 sm:p-10 text-center shadow-lg rounded-sm">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#121212] mb-3">
        Ready to Secure Your European Residency?
      </h3>
      
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#666666] font-sans mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Speak with our intelligence team to discover if you qualify for the remaining 2026 fast-track pathways.
      </p>

      <a 
        href="/special/apply"
        class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#C5A059] hover:bg-[#B28E46] text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-10 py-4 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-xl cursor-pointer"
      >
        Continue
      </a>

      <p class="text-xs text-[#666666] italic mt-4 font-sans">
        (No obligations. 100% Secure.)
      </p>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>